    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Subscription and domain renewal reminder\nKeep a list of your subscriptions, domains and licences. Get an email 14 days before each renews, so nothing renews by surprise.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9cf84bc0-18b4-5bad-b8de-833d003d0f78",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Renewals** and these headers in row 1: see `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings** and fill in your sheet URL, your email and names.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and Gmail on the nodes with warnings.\n4. Check the rule in **Find rows to act on** (it shows exactly which rows get an email) and the wording in **Send email**.\n5. Run it once by hand with a test row, then switch the workflow to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "2189d6d0-f161-54af-a1e5-2b3f46831865",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -400
      ]
    }
  ],
